## Why This Is Asked
Tests IPCA in streaming, drift handling, latency, and interpretability of loadings in real-time.

## Key Concepts
- Incremental PCA with partial_fit
- Streaming imputation and running statistics
- Drift detection (ADWIN, CUSUM)
- Adaptive component retention to target explained variance
- Loadings-to-alert mapping by feature groups
- Latency budgeting with micro-batches

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo IPCA usage (conceptual)
const ipca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents:12});
for (const batch of stream){
  const X = impute(batch);
  ipca.partialFit(X);
  const Z = ipca.transform(X);
}
```

